+    // diverged and unmounting a MarkerView crashed with "Trying to remove a
+    // view index above child count" (IllegalViewOperationException in
+    // manageChildren). Worse, reanimated's ReanimatedNativeHierarchyManager
+    // re-adds exit-animating children at index getChildCount() and removes
+    // them later, so the view must faithfully track ANY number of children at
+    // ANY position. We keep an honest list; only the first React child is the
+    // marker content shown on the map, extra entries (reanimated re-adds) are
+    // bookkeeping only.
